		{
			"id":100000,
			"actionList":[{"whoID":1,"whichACT":0},{"whoID":3,"whichACT":2}],
			"soundList":[],"letterTone":3,
			"cameraMovement":{"x":0.0,"y":-0.5},
			"isInstantText":false,
			"speakerColorRGB":{"r":1.0,"g":0.65,"b":0.85,"a":1.0},
			"speakerName":"Nene",
			"speakerDialogue":"You must be Maya, right? Nice to meet ya, name's Nene.<@:LINE_BREAK>The blonde fairy told me you'd be coming.",
			"miscText":"Friendly witch?"
		},
		{
			"id":100000,
			"actionList":[{"whoID":1,"whichACT":2},{"whoID":3,"whichACT":0}],
			"soundList":[],"letterTone":1,
			"cameraMovement":{"x":0.0,"y":-0.5},
			"isInstantText":false,
			"speakerColorRGB":{"r":1.0,"g":0.15,"b":0.15,"a":1.0},
			"speakerName":"Maya",
			"speakerDialogue":"Nice to meet you too.<@:LINE_BREAK>So... you're a witch?",
			"miscText":"Friendly Witch?"
		},
		{
			"id":100000,
			"actionList":[{"whoID":1,"whichACT":0},{"whoID":3,"whichACT":2}],
			"soundList":[],"letterTone":3,
			"cameraMovement":{"x":0.0,"y":-0.5},
			"isInstantText":false,
			"speakerColorRGB":{"r":1.0,"g":0.65,"b":0.85,"a":1.0},
			"speakerName":"Nene",
			"speakerDialogue":"Ey, the relatively bad reputation against us witches is undeserved, alright? It's nothing more than baseless rumors, spread by the unwashed masses!",
			"miscText":"Friendly Witch?"
		},
		{
			"id":100000,
			"actionList":[{"whoID":1,"whichACT":0},{"whoID":3,"whichACT":2}],
			"soundList":[],"letterTone":3,
			"cameraMovement":{"x":0.0,"y":-0.5},
			"isInstantText":false,
			"speakerColorRGB":{"r":1.0,"g":0.65,"b":0.85,"a":1.0},
			"speakerName":"Nene",
			"speakerDialogue":"Besides, I'm one of the good ones and we're in the same predicament out here, so... let's be friends and work togheter, ya feel me?",
			"miscText":"Friendly Witch?"
		},
		{
			"id":100001,
			"actionList":[{"whoID":1,"whichACT":2},{"whoID":3,"whichACT":0}],
			"soundList":[],"letterTone":1,
			"cameraMovement":{"x":0.0,"y":-0.5},
			"isInstantText":false,
			"speakerColorRGB":{"r":1.0,"g":0.15,"b":0.15,"a":1.0},
			"speakerName":"Maya",
			"speakerDialogue":"Do you really live alone in this decrepit castle?",
			"miscText":"Stuck here"
		},
		{
			"id":100001,
			"actionList":[{"whoID":1,"whichACT":0},{"whoID":3,"whichACT":2}],
			"soundList":[],"letterTone":3,
			"cameraMovement":{"x":0.0,"y":-0.5},
			"isInstantText":false,
			"speakerColorRGB":{"r":1.0,"g":0.65,"b":0.85,"a":1.0},
			"speakerName":"Nene",
			"speakerDialogue":"Yeah, but I'm forced to. This grand hall is about the only safe spot on the whole island, because there's a barrier that repels all the baddies.",
			"miscText":"Stuck here"
		},
		{
			"id":100001,
			"actionList":[{"whoID":1,"whichACT":0},{"whoID":3,"whichACT":2}],
			"soundList":[],"letterTone":3,
			"cameraMovement":{"x":0.0,"y":-0.5},
			"isInstantText":false,
			"speakerColorRGB":{"r":1.0,"g":0.65,"b":0.85,"a":1.0},
			"speakerName":"Nene",
			"speakerDialogue":"Until I escape from this island, it's a decent enough place to bunker in and do my thing.",
			"miscText":"Stuck here"
		},
		{
			"id":100001,
			"actionList":[{"whoID":1,"whichACT":2},{"whoID":3,"whichACT":0}],
			"soundList":[],"letterTone":1,
			"cameraMovement":{"x":0.0,"y":-0.5},
			"isInstantText":false,
			"speakerColorRGB":{"r":1.0,"g":0.15,"b":0.15,"a":1.0},
			"speakerName":"Maya",
			"speakerDialogue":"So that's why Farina said that it's safe in here.<@:LINE_BREAK>A barrier huh? Wait, then you aren't a native?",
			"miscText":"Stuck here"
		},
		{
			"id":100001,
			"actionList":[{"whoID":1,"whichACT":0},{"whoID":3,"whichACT":2}],
			"soundList":[],"letterTone":3,
			"cameraMovement":{"x":0.0,"y":-0.5},
			"isInstantText":false,
			"speakerColorRGB":{"r":1.0,"g":0.65,"b":0.85,"a":1.0},
			"speakerName":"Nene",
			"speakerDialogue":"No silly, I'm lost in here, just like you and many others.<@:LINE_BREAK>One moment I'm home, doing a lil' experiment, it goes wrong, then BOOM, I'm upside down, stuck in the sand out there.",
			"miscText":"Stuck here"
		},
		{
			"id":100001,
			"actionList":[{"whoID":1,"whichACT":2},{"whoID":3,"whichACT":0}],
			"soundList":[],"letterTone":1,
			"cameraMovement":{"x":0.0,"y":-0.5},
			"isInstantText":false,
			"speakerColorRGB":{"r":1.0,"g":0.15,"b":0.15,"a":1.0},
			"speakerName":"Maya",
			"speakerDialogue":"Oh wow! So you were teleported here?! How is that even possible?!",
			"miscText":"Stuck here"
		},
		{
			"id":100001,
			"actionList":[{"whoID":1,"whichACT":0},{"whoID":3,"whichACT":2}],
			"soundList":[],"letterTone":3,
			"cameraMovement":{"x":0.0,"y":-0.5},
			"isInstantText":false,
			"speakerColorRGB":{"r":1.0,"g":0.65,"b":0.85,"a":1.0},
			"speakerName":"Nene",
			"speakerDialogue":"That's what I've been asking myself for two years now.<@:LINE_BREAK>I've seen folks get shipwrecked, fall from the sky, emerge from the ocean, get spat out from some random portal, you name it...",
			"miscText":"Stuck here"
		},
		{
			"id":100001,
			"actionList":[{"whoID":1,"whichACT":0},{"whoID":3,"whichACT":2}],
			"soundList":[],"letterTone":3,
			"cameraMovement":{"x":0.0,"y":-0.5},
			"isInstantText":false,
			"speakerColorRGB":{"r":1.0,"g":0.65,"b":0.85,"a":1.0},
			"speakerName":"Nene",
			"speakerDialogue":"This island is up to no good, I'm telling ya. It attracts people out here, and only hell knows why.",
			"miscText":"Stuck here"
		},
		{
			"id":100002,
			"actionList":[{"whoID":1,"whichACT":0},{"whoID":3,"whichACT":2}],
			"soundList":[],"letterTone":3,
			"cameraMovement":{"x":0.0,"y":-0.5},
			"isInstantText":false,
			"speakerColorRGB":{"r":1.0,"g":0.65,"b":0.85,"a":1.0},
			"speakerName":"Nene",
			"speakerDialogue":"Hey Maya, I've got a proposition for ya. I've been studying the phenomena of this island and I'm doing different experiments to look for a way to reverse the portal that brought me here.",
			"miscText":"Essence and Shop"
		},
		{
			"id":100002,
			"actionList":[{"whoID":1,"whichACT":0},{"whoID":3,"whichACT":2}],
			"soundList":[],"letterTone":3,
			"cameraMovement":{"x":0.0,"y":-0.5},
			"isInstantText":false,
			"speakerColorRGB":{"r":1.0,"g":0.65,"b":0.85,"a":1.0},
			"speakerName":"Nene",
			"speakerDialogue":"But to run those tests, I need a natural reagent from the very land that I'm trying to magically study. Basically, I need the essence of this island in its materialized form.",
			"miscText":"Essence and Shop"
		},
		{
			"id":100002,
			"actionList":[{"whoID":1,"whichACT":0},{"whoID":3,"whichACT":2}],
			"soundList":[],"letterTone":3,
			"cameraMovement":{"x":0.0,"y":-0.5},
			"isInstantText":false,
			"speakerColorRGB":{"r":1.0,"g":0.65,"b":0.85,"a":1.0},
			"speakerName":"Nene",
			"speakerDialogue":"You see, I've setup a lil' shop here, and I've been bargaining with other lost folk that pass through here. I've amassed a lot of trinkets and other useful scrap over those years.",
			"miscText":"Essence and Shop"
		},
		{
			"id":100002,
			"actionList":[{"whoID":1,"whichACT":0},{"whoID":3,"whichACT":2}],
			"soundList":[],"letterTone":3,
			"cameraMovement":{"x":0.0,"y":-0.5},
			"isInstantText":false,
			"speakerColorRGB":{"r":1.0,"g":0.65,"b":0.85,"a":1.0},
			"speakerName":"Nene",
			"speakerDialogue":"So here's the deal: you go out there and gather Essence for me, and in exchange I'll trade some of my  goodies with ya.<@:LINE_BREAK>How does that sound?",
			"miscText":"Essence and Shop"
		},
		{
			"id":100002,
			"actionList":[{"whoID":1,"whichACT":6},{"whoID":3,"whichACT":0}],
			"soundList":[],"letterTone":1,
			"cameraMovement":{"x":0.0,"y":-0.5},
			"isInstantText":false,
			"speakerColorRGB":{"r":1.0,"g":0.15,"b":0.15,"a":1.0},
			"speakerName":"Maya",
			"speakerDialogue":"Sounds fishy to be honest.<@:LINE_BREAK>Why can't you go gather it yourself?",
			"miscText":"Essence and Shop"
		},
		{
			"id":100002,
			"actionList":[{"whoID":1,"whichACT":0},{"whoID":3,"whichACT":2}],
			"soundList":[],"letterTone":3,
			"cameraMovement":{"x":0.0,"y":-0.5},
			"isInstantText":false,
			"speakerColorRGB":{"r":1.0,"g":0.65,"b":0.85,"a":1.0},
			"speakerName":"Nene",
			"speakerDialogue":"You little... Listen, I want to flee from this shithole as soon as possible. But I need someone to bring me the reagent, to continue furthering my research. I'm trying to find a way to save all of us!",
			"miscText":"Essence and Shop"
		},
		{
			"id":100002,
			"actionList":[{"whoID":1,"whichACT":2},{"whoID":3,"whichACT":0}],
			"soundList":[],"letterTone":1,
			"cameraMovement":{"x":0.0,"y":-0.5},
			"isInstantText":false,
			"speakerColorRGB":{"r":1.0,"g":0.15,"b":0.15,"a":1.0},
			"speakerName":"Maya",
			"speakerDialogue":"Hmmm okay, that makes sense, I guess.<@:LINE_BREAK>But where do I find this Essence stuff anyways?",
			"miscText":"Essence and Shop"
		},
		{
			"id":100002,
			"actionList":[{"whoID":1,"whichACT":0},{"whoID":3,"whichACT":2}],
			"soundList":[],"letterTone":3,
			"cameraMovement":{"x":0.0,"y":-0.5},
			"isInstantText":false,
			"speakerColorRGB":{"r":1.0,"g":0.65,"b":0.85,"a":1.0},
			"speakerName":"Nene",
			"speakerDialogue":"You have to extract it from the living beings native to this island.",
			"miscText":"Essence and Shop"
		},
		{
			"id":100002,
			"actionList":[{"whoID":1,"whichACT":2},{"whoID":3,"whichACT":0}],
			"soundList":[],"letterTone":1,
			"cameraMovement":{"x":0.0,"y":-0.5},
			"isInstantText":false,
			"speakerColorRGB":{"r":1.0,"g":0.15,"b":0.15,"a":1.0},
			"speakerName":"Maya",
			"speakerDialogue":"What?! Living beings? So like... wait, what do you mean by extract?!",
			"miscText":"Essence and Shop"
		},
		{
			"id":100002,
			"actionList":[{"whoID":1,"whichACT":0},{"whoID":3,"whichACT":2}],
			"soundList":[],"letterTone":3,
			"cameraMovement":{"x":0.0,"y":-0.5},
			"isInstantText":false,
			"speakerColorRGB":{"r":1.0,"g":0.65,"b":0.85,"a":1.0},
			"speakerName":"Nene",
			"speakerDialogue":"Listen, I don't make the rules, I'm just telling ya how it is.<@:LINE_BREAK>I'm sure you'll figure things out, hihihi...<@:LINE_BREAK>Once you've gathered enough, bring them to me!",
			"miscText":"Essence and Shop"
		},
		{
			"id":100003,
			"actionList":[{"whoID":1,"whichACT":0},{"whoID":3,"whichACT":2}],
			"soundList":[],"letterTone":3,
			"cameraMovement":{"x":0.0,"y":-0.5},
			"isInstantText":false,
			"speakerColorRGB":{"r":1.0,"g":0.65,"b":0.85,"a":1.0},
			"speakerName":"Nene",
			"speakerDialogue":"Ey, I heard ya going to the other side of the beaches?<@:LINE_BREAK>Nah I don't go to those parts, too dangerous for me.",
			"miscText":"Shipwreck and Loot"
		},
		{
			"id":100003,
			"actionList":[{"whoID":1,"whichACT":0},{"whoID":3,"whichACT":2}],
			"soundList":[],"letterTone":3,
			"cameraMovement":{"x":0.0,"y":-0.5},
			"isInstantText":false,
			"speakerColorRGB":{"r":1.0,"g":0.65,"b":0.85,"a":1.0},
			"speakerName":"Nene",
			"speakerDialogue":"But when you get there, keep an eye open for chests and such.<@:LINE_BREAK>With so many shipwrecks, for sure some meaty loot must have survived the crash, ripe for the taking!",
			"miscText":""
		},
		{
			"id":100003,
			"actionList":[{"whoID":1,"whichACT":6},{"whoID":3,"whichACT":0}],
			"soundList":[],"letterTone":1,
			"cameraMovement":{"x":0.0,"y":-0.5},
			"isInstantText":false,
			"speakerColorRGB":{"r":1.0,"g":0.15,"b":0.15,"a":1.0},
			"speakerName":"Maya",
			"speakerDialogue":"Hmm okay? I'm an adventurer, of course I'm going to open ALL the chests!",
			"miscText":""
		},
		{
			"id":100003,
			"actionList":[{"whoID":1,"whichACT":0},{"whoID":3,"whichACT":2}],
			"soundList":[],"letterTone":3,
			"cameraMovement":{"x":0.0,"y":-0.5},
			"isInstantText":false,
			"speakerColorRGB":{"r":1.0,"g":0.65,"b":0.85,"a":1.0},
			"speakerName":"Nene",
			"speakerDialogue":"All I'm saying is, when you collect the plunder, bring any particularly shiny object directly to me, we good?",
			"miscText":""
		},
		{
			"id":100003,
			"actionList":[{"whoID":1,"whichACT":2},{"whoID":3,"whichACT":0}],
			"soundList":[],"letterTone":1,
			"cameraMovement":{"x":0.0,"y":-0.5},
			"isInstantText":false,
			"speakerColorRGB":{"r":1.0,"g":0.15,"b":0.15,"a":1.0},
			"speakerName":"Maya",
			"speakerDialogue":"I... I'll think about it.<@:LINE_BREAK>No promisses tough!",
			"miscText":""
		}
	]
}